# WIRD | وِرد Environment Variables Example
# By default, WIRD operates 100% locally with zero required external credentials.
# All reading progress, Khatmah plans, and bookmarks are securely stored in your browser's LocalStorage.

# Optional: Supabase configuration (Only if implementing optional cross-device synchronization)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
